# The Brain vault (agent-written memory).
#
# `remember()` appends markdown notes here; the graphify sidecar mounts this
# folder read-only as part of its corpus and rebuilds the graph on change.
# Nova seeds brain/README.md as part of the core/memory lane — this .gitkeep
# only guarantees the directory exists so the compose bind-mount resolves
# instead of being auto-created as a root-owned empty dir.
